  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Technical Dashboard / Data Grid\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Technical Dashboard / Data Grid\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\\\"en\\\"><head><style> :root { --bg-navy: #10253F; --line-blue: #3D6FB4; --chalk: #F2F0E6; --amber: #F2A93B; --slate: #7C93AC; --green: #4FA87B; --red: #C4634F; --f-display: \'Space Grotesk\', \'Impact\', sans-serif; --f-body: \'Inter\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif; --f-mono: \'IBM Plex Mono\', \'Courier New\', monospace; } * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; } body { background-color: var(--bg-navy); color: var(--chalk); font-family: var(--f-body); overflow: hidden; width: 1024px; height: 768px; } .blueprint-grid { background-image: linear-gradient(var(--line-blue) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line-blue) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px; background-color: var(--bg-navy); opacity: 0.1; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; } .main-container { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 32px; gap: 24px; } header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; } .logo { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; } .nav-btns { display: flex; gap: 16px; } .btn-outline { border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 14px; background: transparent; color: var(--chalk); font-weight: 500; } .btn-filled { background-color: var(--amber); color: var(--bg-navy); padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; border: none; } .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; } h1 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 12px; } .hero-sub { color: var(--slate); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 24px; } .steps-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; flex: 1; } .section-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--slate); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 8px; } .card { background: rgba(242, 240, 230, 0.03); border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); padding: 16px; position: relative; } .upload-zone { border: 2px dashed var(--line-blue); padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: var(--slate); font-size: 13px; } .input-group { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; } input { background: var(--chalk); border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: var(--f-body); font-size: 13px; flex: 1; color: var(--bg-navy); } .mono { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 12px; } .badge { padding: 2px 6px; font-size: 10px; background: var(--slate); color: var(--bg-navy); border-radius: 2px; } .fit-pill { background: var(--green); color: var(--bg-navy); padding: 4px 12px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 12px; } .roadmap-path { display: flex; gap: 12px; position: relative; } .roadmap-item { flex: 1; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); background: rgba(242, 240, 230, 0.05); } .copy-btn { border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); background: transparent; color: var(--chalk); font-size: 11px; padding: 4px 8px; margin-left: 8px; cursor: pointer; } .status-pills { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; } .status-btn { border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--chalk); } .status-btn.active { background: var(--amber); color: var(--bg-navy); border-color: var(--amber); } .roadmap-line { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 0; right: 0; height: 1px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line-blue); z-index: -1; } </style></head><body><div class=\\\"blueprint-grid\\\"></div><div class=\\\"main-container\\\"><header><div class=\\\"logo\\\">NextBuild</div><div class=\\\"nav-btns\\\"><button class=\\\"btn-outline\\\">Sign In</button><button class=\\\"btn-filled\\\">Get Started</button></div></header><div class=\\\"hero\\\"><div><h1>See exactly what to build next to land your target job</h1><p class=\\\"hero-sub\\\">Connect your resume and GitHub. We\'ll show you how your projects stack up against the job you want, and exactly what to build to close the gap.</p><button class=\\\"btn-filled\\\">Get Started</button></div><div class=\\\"hero-diagram\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 500 120\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><line x1=\\\"50\\\" y1=\\\"50\\\" x2=\\\"450\\\" y2=\\\"50\\\" stroke=\\\"#3D6FB4\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"4 4\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#F2F0E6\\\"/><text x=\\\"50\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#7C93AC\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" font-family=\\\"Inter\\\">Resume + GitHub</text><circle cx=\\\"150\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#F2F0E6\\\"/><text x=\\\"150\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#7C93AC\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" font-family=\\\"Inter\\\">Job Description</text><circle cx=\\\"250\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"#F2A93B\\\"/><text x=\\\"250\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#F2A93B\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" font-family=\\\"Inter\\\" font-weight=\\\"bold\\\">Fit Analysis</text><circle cx=\\\"350\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#F2F0E6\\\"/><text x=\\\"350\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#7C93AC\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" font-family=\\\"Inter\\\">Roadmap</text><circle cx=\\\"450\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#F2F0E6\\\"/><text x=\\\"450\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#7C93AC\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" font-family=\\\"Inter\\\">Applied</text></svg></div></div><div class=\\\"steps-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Step 1 \342\200\224 Your Resume</div><div class=\\\"upload-zone\\\"><svg width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\"><path d=\\\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M17 8l-5-5-5 5M12 3v12\\\"/></svg><p>Drop your PDF or DOCX resume here, or click to browse</p></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:12px; font-size:12px; display:flex; align-items:center; color:var(--chalk)\\\"><svg width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#4FA87B\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" style=\\\"margin-right:6px\\\"><polyline points=\\\"20 6 9 17 4 12\\\"/></svg>alex_chen_resume.pdf <span style=\\\"color:var(--slate); margin-left:8px; text-decoration:underline; cursor:pointer\\\">Remove</span></div></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Step 2 \342\200\224 Your GitHub</div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"GitHub username or profile URL\\\"><button class=\\\"btn-outline\\\" style=\\\"background:var(--line-blue); border:none\\\">Connect</button></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px\\\"><div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px; border-style:dashed\\\"><div class=\\\"mono\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--amber)\\\">e-commerce-api</div><p style=\\\"font-size:11px; color:var(--slate)\\\">RESTful backend with Node.js</p><div style=\\\"display:flex; gap:4px; margin-top:4px\\\"><span class=\\\"badge mono\\\">Node.js</span><span class=\\\"badge mono\\\">Postgres</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Step 3 \342\200\224 The Job You Want</div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Paste a job posting link\\\"><button class=\\\"btn-outline\\\" style=\\\"background:var(--line-blue); border:none\\\">Fetch</button></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family:var(--f-display); font-weight:bold; font-size:14px\\\">Backend Engineer (L4)</div><div style=\\\"font-size:12px; color:var(--slate)\\\">Stripe \342\200\242 Remote</div><p style=\\\"font-size:11px; margin-top:4px; line-height:1.4\\\">Building the next generation of financial infrastructure. Requires expertise in Ruby, Go, and scalable systems...</p></div></div></div><div class=\\\"steps-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Your Fit Analysis</div><div class=\\\"fit-pill\\\">Strong Match</div><div class=\\\"mono\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px; margin-bottom:4px\\\">e-commerce-api</div><p style=\\\"font-size:11px; line-height:1.4; color:var(--chalk)\\\">Your API project shows strong backend skills, but this role also wants Redis experience which isn\'t reflected yet.</p><div style=\\\"font-size:9px; color:var(--slate); margin-top:12px\\\">AI-generated guidance \342\200\224 not a guarantee of recruiter results.</div></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Your Build Plan</div><div class=\\\"roadmap-path\\\"><div class=\\\"roadmap-item\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family:var(--f-display); font-size:13px\\\">Caching Layer</div><p style=\\\"font-size:10px; color:var(--slate); margin:4px 0\\\">Implement Redis for the API.</p><span class=\\\"badge mono\\\">Redis</span><div style=\\\"font-size:10px; color:var(--slate); margin-top:8px\\\">~1 week</div></div><div class=\\\"roadmap-item\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family:var(--f-display); font-size:13px\\\">Load Tester</div><p style=\\\"font-size:10px; color:var(--slate); margin:4px 0\\\">Benchmarking system throughput.</p><span class=\\\"badge mono\\\">Go</span><div style=\\\"font-size:10px; color:var(--slate); margin-top:8px\\\">~3 days</div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Ready to Apply</div><div style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding:10px; border-radius:4px\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center\\\"><span class=\\\"mono\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10px; color:var(--slate)\\\">Resume Summary</span><button class=\\\"copy-btn\\\">Copy</button></div><p style=\\\"font-size:11px; margin-top:4px\\\">Backend specialist with proven experience building RESTful APIs and distributed caching systems...</p></div><div class=\\\"status-pills\\\"><button class=\\\"status-btn\\\">Saved</button><button class=\\\"status-btn active\\\">Applied</button><button class=\\\"status-btn\\\">Interviewing</button></div></div></div></div></body></html>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Technical Dashboard / Data Grid\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Technical Dashboard / Data Grid\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\\\"en\\\"><head><style> :root { --bg-navy: #10253F; --line-blue: #3D6FB4; --chalk: #F2F0E6; --amber: #F2A93B; --slate: #7C93AC; --green: #4FA87B; --red: #C4634F; --f-display: \'Space Grotesk\', \'Impact\', sans-serif; --f-body: \'Inter\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif; --f-mono: \'IBM Plex Mono\', \'Courier New\', monospace; } * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; } body { background-color: var(--bg-navy); color: var(--chalk); font-family: var(--f-body); overflow: hidden; width: 1024px; height: 768px; } .blueprint-grid { background-image: linear-gradient(var(--line-blue) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line-blue) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px; background-color: var(--bg-navy); opacity: 0.1; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; } .main-container { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 32px; gap: 24px; } header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; } .logo { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; } .nav-btns { display: flex; gap: 16px; } .btn-outline { border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 14px; background: transparent; color: var(--chalk); font-weight: 500; } .btn-filled { background-color: var(--amber); color: var(--bg-navy); padding: 8px 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; border: none; } .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; } h1 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 12px; } .hero-sub { color: var(--slate); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 24px; } .steps-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; flex: 1; } .section-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--slate); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 8px; } .card { background: rgba(242, 240, 230, 0.03); border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); padding: 16px; position: relative; } .upload-zone { border: 2px dashed var(--line-blue); padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: var(--slate); font-size: 13px; } .input-group { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; } input { background: var(--chalk); border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: var(--f-body); font-size: 13px; flex: 1; color: var(--bg-navy); } .mono { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 12px; } .badge { padding: 2px 6px; font-size: 10px; background: var(--slate); color: var(--bg-navy); border-radius: 2px; } .fit-pill { background: var(--green); color: var(--bg-navy); padding: 4px 12px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 12px; } .roadmap-path { display: flex; gap: 12px; position: relative; } .roadmap-item { flex: 1; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); background: rgba(242, 240, 230, 0.05); } .copy-btn { border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); background: transparent; color: var(--chalk); font-size: 11px; padding: 4px 8px; margin-left: 8px; cursor: pointer; } .status-pills { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; } .status-btn { border: 1px solid var(--line-blue); padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--chalk); } .status-btn.active { background: var(--amber); color: var(--bg-navy); border-color: var(--amber); } .roadmap-line { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 0; right: 0; height: 1px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line-blue); z-index: -1; } </style></head><body><div class=\\\"blueprint-grid\\\"></div><div class=\\\"main-container\\\"><header><div class=\\\"logo\\\">NextBuild</div><div class=\\\"nav-btns\\\"><button class=\\\"btn-outline\\\">Sign In</button><button class=\\\"btn-filled\\\">Get Started</button></div></header><div class=\\\"hero\\\"><div><h1>See exactly what to build next to land your target job</h1><p class=\\\"hero-sub\\\">Connect your resume and GitHub. We\'ll show you how your projects stack up against the job you want, and exactly what to build to close the gap.</p><button class=\\\"btn-filled\\\">Get Started</button></div><div class=\\\"hero-diagram\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 500 120\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><line x1=\\\"50\\\" y1=\\\"50\\\" x2=\\\"450\\\" y2=\\\"50\\\" stroke=\\\"#3D6FB4\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"4 4\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#F2F0E6\\\"/><text x=\\\"50\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#7C93AC\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" font-family=\\\"Inter\\\">Resume + GitHub</text><circle cx=\\\"150\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#F2F0E6\\\"/><text x=\\\"150\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#7C93AC\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" font-family=\\\"Inter\\\">Job Description</text><circle cx=\\\"250\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"#F2A93B\\\"/><text x=\\\"250\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#F2A93B\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" font-family=\\\"Inter\\\" font-weight=\\\"bold\\\">Fit Analysis</text><circle cx=\\\"350\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#F2F0E6\\\"/><text x=\\\"350\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#7C93AC\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" font-family=\\\"Inter\\\">Roadmap</text><circle cx=\\\"450\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#F2F0E6\\\"/><text x=\\\"450\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#7C93AC\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" font-family=\\\"Inter\\\">Applied</text></svg></div></div><div class=\\\"steps-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Step 1 \342\200\224 Your Resume</div><div class=\\\"upload-zone\\\"><svg width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\"><path d=\\\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M17 8l-5-5-5 5M12 3v12\\\"/></svg><p>Drop your PDF or DOCX resume here, or click to browse</p></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:12px; font-size:12px; display:flex; align-items:center; color:var(--chalk)\\\"><svg width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#4FA87B\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" style=\\\"margin-right:6px\\\"><polyline points=\\\"20 6 9 17 4 12\\\"/></svg>alex_chen_resume.pdf <span style=\\\"color:var(--slate); margin-left:8px; text-decoration:underline; cursor:pointer\\\">Remove</span></div></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Step 2 \342\200\224 Your GitHub</div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"GitHub username or profile URL\\\"><button class=\\\"btn-outline\\\" style=\\\"background:var(--line-blue); border:none\\\">Connect</button></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px\\\"><div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px; border-style:dashed\\\"><div class=\\\"mono\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--amber)\\\">e-commerce-api</div><p style=\\\"font-size:11px; color:var(--slate)\\\">RESTful backend with Node.js</p><div style=\\\"display:flex; gap:4px; margin-top:4px\\\"><span class=\\\"badge mono\\\">Node.js</span><span class=\\\"badge mono\\\">Postgres</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Step 3 \342\200\224 The Job You Want</div><div class=\\\"input-group\\\"><input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Paste a job posting link\\\"><button class=\\\"btn-outline\\\" style=\\\"background:var(--line-blue); border:none\\\">Fetch</button></div><div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family:var(--f-display); font-weight:bold; font-size:14px\\\">Backend Engineer (L4)</div><div style=\\\"font-size:12px; color:var(--slate)\\\">Stripe \342\200\242 Remote</div><p style=\\\"font-size:11px; margin-top:4px; line-height:1.4\\\">Building the next generation of financial infrastructure. Requires expertise in Ruby, Go, and scalable systems...</p></div></div></div><div class=\\\"steps-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Your Fit Analysis</div><div class=\\\"fit-pill\\\">Strong Match</div><div class=\\\"mono\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px; margin-bottom:4px\\\">e-commerce-api</div><p style=\\\"font-size:11px; line-height:1.4; color:var(--chalk)\\\">Your API project shows strong backend skills, but this role also wants Redis experience which isn\'t reflected yet.</p><div style=\\\"font-size:9px; color:var(--slate); margin-top:12px\\\">AI-generated guidance \342\200\224 not a guarantee of recruiter results.</div></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Your Build Plan</div><div class=\\\"roadmap-path\\\"><div class=\\\"roadmap-item\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family:var(--f-display); font-size:13px\\\">Caching Layer</div><p style=\\\"font-size:10px; color:var(--slate); margin:4px 0\\\">Implement Redis for the API.</p><span class=\\\"badge mono\\\">Redis</span><div style=\\\"font-size:10px; color:var(--slate); margin-top:8px\\\">~1 week</div></div><div class=\\\"roadmap-item\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family:var(--f-display); font-size:13px\\\">Load Tester</div><p style=\\\"font-size:10px; color:var(--slate); margin:4px 0\\\">Benchmarking system throughput.</p><span class=\\\"badge mono\\\">Go</span><div style=\\\"font-size:10px; color:var(--slate); margin-top:8px\\\">~3 days</div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"section-label\\\">Ready to Apply</div><div style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding:10px; border-radius:4px\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center\\\"><span class=\\\"mono\\\" style=\\\"font-size:10px; color:var(--slate)\\\">Resume Summary</span><button class=\\\"copy-btn\\\">Copy</button></div><p style=\\\"font-size:11px; margin-top:4px\\\">Backend specialist with proven experience building RESTful APIs and distributed caching systems...</p></div><div class=\\\"status-pills\\\"><button class=\\\"status-btn\\\">Saved</button><button class=\\\"status-btn active\\\">Applied</button><button class=\\\"status-btn\\\">Interviewing</button></div></div></div></div></body></html>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
