    modified_response: "I have built and integrated the full backend infrastructure and AI analysis pipeline for **NextBuild**:\n\n- **Server-Side Architecture**: Implemented an Express backend server with Node ESM support, proxying all Gemini AI calls server-side to protect API credentials and maintain real-time telemetry.\n- **Resume Intake & Parsing API**: Created `/api/resume/parse` to extract candidate education, top technical skills, and project history into structured JSON using `gemini-3.6-flash`.\n- **GitHub Profile Analysis Engine**: Built `/api/github/analyze` with direct integration to GitHub\'s REST API and Gemini fallback summarization to index public repositories, tech stacks, and project complexity.\n- **Job Description & Scraping Pipeline**: Created `/api/jd/parse` to normalize job postings from LinkedIn, Naukri, and Indeed into structured tech stack requirements and domain signals.\n- **Company Research Enrichment**: Implemented non-blocking background enrichment (`/api/company/research`) with Google Search grounding to incorporate company-specific architecture notes, microservices focus, and engineering blog signals.\n- **Fit Analysis Engine**: Built `/api/analysis/fit` to generate overall match percentages, project-by-project verdicts, and advisory explanations.\n- **Roadmap & Application Package Generators**: Integrated `/api/roadmap/generate` and `/api/package/generate` to produce 3-step project build milestones, tailored resume highlight summaries, and role blurbs."
