  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have completed the supplementary implementation requirements for authentication security, data retention/privacy, and automated unit testing:\n\n- **Auth Security Implementation (`/src/services/auth.ts` & `/server.ts`)**:\n  - **Password Hashing**: Implemented `bcrypt` password hashing (`bcryptjs`) with 10 salt rounds. Plaintext passwords are never stored.\n  - **Server-Side Validation**: Enforced a minimum password length of 8+ characters at the registration endpoint (`POST /api/auth/register`).\n  - **JWT Token Lifecycle**:\n    - **Short-Lived Access Tokens**: Issued with a 15-minute expiration window containing candidate identification payloads.\n    - **Long-Lived Refresh Tokens**: Issued with a 7-day expiration window, tracked in a `refresh_tokens` database structure supporting explicit revocation (`POST /api/auth/refresh` and `POST /api/auth/logout`).\n    - Secrets are managed safely via environment variables (`JWT_SECRET` and `JWT_REFRESH_SECRET`).\n\n- **Data Retention & Privacy Policy (`/PRIVACY.md` & `/api/profile`)**:\n  - **Privacy Documentation**: Authored `PRIVACY.md` detailing PII storage rules, ephemeral file handling, and candidate data rights.\n  - **Ephemeral Resume Handling**: Uploaded resume files are parsed in-memory into structured candidate JSON data, with raw file content discarded immediately to prevent unnecessary lingering PII storage.\n  - **Account & PII Deletion Endpoint**: Created an authenticated `DELETE /api/profile` endpoint that soft-deletes candidate user records (`deleted_at` timestamp), revokes all active refresh tokens, and purges parsed resume data and student profiles.\n\n- **Automated Unit Test Suite (`/tests/fitEngine.test.ts`)**:\n  - **Vitest Integration**: Integrated Vitest (`npm test`) with 4 deterministic unit tests mocking Gemini API responses.\n  - **Fallback Testing**: Verified that fit analysis functions correctly both with and without company research context, accurately setting the `informedByCompanyResearch` boolean flag.\n  - **Mismatch & Match Scoring**: Verified that mismatched candidates (e.g., CSS animations vs ML infrastructure) receive a `\'Needs Work\'` verdict with low fit scores, while aligned projects yield a `\'Strong Match\'` verdict.\n  - **Structural Error Resilience**: Verified that LLM API timeouts or exceptions fail gracefully into valid response schemas preserving error handling and default project evaluations."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
