  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have completed Phase 2: Auth Hardening, Data Privacy Controls, and Fit-Engine Unit Testing.\n\n### Key Improvements Implemented:\n\n1. **Auth Security Hardening** (`src/services/auth.ts`, `server.ts`):\n   - **Bcrypt Password Hashing**: Enforced password hashing for all user accounts via `bcryptjs`. Plaintext passwords are never stored.\n   - **Password Length Enforcement**: Added server-side validation rejecting passwords shorter than 8 characters during registration with a `400 Bad Request` response.\n   - **Token Expiry & Lifecycle**: Updated access token expiration to **30 minutes** and refresh token expiration to **14 days**.\n   - **Refresh & Revocation Endpoints**: Implemented `POST /api/auth/refresh` for silent token refresh and `POST /api/auth/logout` to revoke active refresh tokens in the stored revocation list.\n\n2. **Data Privacy Controls & Retention** (`PRIVACY.md`, `server.ts`, `src/services/auth.ts`):\n   - **Privacy Policy (`PRIVACY.md`)**: Added documentation detailing what student data is stored, why it is needed, and retention policies.\n   - **In-Memory Resume Processing**: Uploaded resume files are parsed in-memory into structured JSON. Raw uploaded file binaries are discarded immediately post-parsing.\n   - **Soft-Delete & PII Cascading**: Added `deletedAt` soft-deletion. Calling `DELETE /api/profile` immediately purges candidate resume JSON, unlinks GitHub metadata, revokes all refresh tokens, and soft-deletes the user record. Company research cache remains intact as non-student corporate metadata.\n\n3. **Fit Engine Unit Test Suite** (`tests/fitEngine.test.ts`):\n   - Created Vitest unit tests for `evaluateFit` using mocked Gemini API responses.\n   - Verified **fallback behavior** when company research is absent versus present (`informedByCompanyResearch` flag assertion).\n   - Verified **mismatched project inputs** (e.g., CSS animation project vs. ML job description) correctly output a low fit score (<50) and `Needs Work` verdict.\n   - Verified **strong match cases** output high scores (\342\211\24580) and `Strong Match` verdicts.\n   - Verified **structural validity** under simulated API timeouts/failures, ensuring graceful fallback objects without runtime crashes."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
